# Telynx API Key for SMS sending
# Get from https://telynx.com (create account and generate API key)
# 
# IMPORTANT: Only needed for production deployment
# Local development: Leave empty and use Mock Mode in Settings
# 
# Steps to get API key:
# 1. Sign up at https://telynx.com
# 2. Go to API settings in dashboard
# 3. Create new API key
# 4. Add to Vercel Environment Variables:
#    - Variable name: TELYNX_API_KEY
#    - Variable value: your_actual_api_key
# 5. Redeploy project
